                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nDifficult. \n\nNet filtration pressure = (capillary hydrostatic pressure + interstitial oncotic pressure) - (capillary oncotic pressure + interstitial hydrostatic pressure)\n\nSubstituting the given values, we get:\n\n3 = (25 + 7) - (capillary oncotic pressure + 2)\n\nSimplifying further:\n\n3 = 32 - capillary oncotic pressure - 2\n\ncapillary oncotic pressure = 27\n\nTherefore, the answer is D) 27.",
