                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step-by-step procedure:\n1. Assess the situation and ensure your own safety.\n2. Check for responsiveness by tapping the patient's shoulder and shouting their name.\n3. If the patient is unresponsive, call for help (activate emergency medical services).\n4. Check for breathing by looking, listening, and feeling for breaths.\n5. If the patient is not breathing, start CPR (chest compressions and rescue breaths).\n\nAnswer: C) Check for response and call help. This is the first step in the procedure for assessing an unresponsive patient. It is important to call for help before starting any interventions, as additional medical personnel may be needed and can provide guidance over the phone.",
