                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "A) Start chest compressions immediately - This is not the correct option as we need to first assess the patient's condition before starting any kind of treatment.\nB) Check carotid pulse - This is a good option to start with as it helps us assess the patient's circulation and can give us an idea of their overall condition.\nC) Check for response and call for help - This is the correct option as we need to first check if the patient is responsive and then call for help before starting any kind of treatment.\nD) Start rescue breaths - This is not the correct option as we need to first assess the patient's condition before starting any kind of treatment.\n\nCombining all the information, we need to first check if the patient is responsive and then call for help before starting any kind of treatment. Therefore, the correct answer is C) Check for response and call help.",
