                    {
                        "id": "680010f1-788e-418f-add9-844a19766746",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-17",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: Professor, can you explain the options again?\n\nProfessor: Sure. Option A is to start chest compressions immediately. Option B is to check for a carotid pulse. Option C is to check for a response and call for help. And option D is to start rescue breaths.\n\nStudent: Which option is the correct one?\n\nProfessor: The correct option is C. You should check for a response and call for help. This is because you need to assess the patient's level of consciousness and call for additional medical assistance if needed.\n\nStudent: What should I do if the patient is not responding?\n\nProfessor: If the patient is not responding, you should call for help immediately. This could be calling for an ambulance or getting someone else to call for help while you continue to assess the patient.\n\nStudent: What if the patient is not breathing?\n\nProfessor: If the patient is not breathing, you should start rescue breaths. This involves giving the patient two breaths and then checking for a pulse. If there is no pulse, you should start chest compressions.\n\nStudent: How do I perform chest compressions?\n\nProfessor: To perform chest compressions, you should place the heel of one hand on the center of the patient's chest and place the other hand on top. You should then push down on the chest about two inches and release. You should repeat this at a rate of 100-120 compressions per minute.\n\nStudent: Thank you, Professor. I think I understand what to do now.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "04dfe997-b880-4099-8bf1-886f0e8513fe",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "C, check for response and call for help.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "C",
                                "correct_answer": false
                            }
                        ],
