                        "annotations": []
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "51234bc7-9170-45cc-8494-837fe23af441_3",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": null,
                        "cot_trigger": "lievin-03",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's differentiate using step by step reasoning like a medical expert: \n\n1) We are looking for a study design that is best suited for the research question. \n2) The research question is asking for a comparison of the fat content in expressed breast milk of pre-term infants as compared to term infants. \n3) We want to compare two groups of infants, those that are pre-term and those that are term. \n4) A prospective cohort study would be the best study design for this research question.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "0",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "Prospective coho",
                                "answer_from_choices": "",
                                "correct_answer": false
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "lievin",
                        "date": null,
                        "api_service": "",
                        "model": "{'name': 'text-davinci-002'}",
                        "comment": "",
                        "annotations": []
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "51234bc7-9170-45cc-8494-837fe23af441_4",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": null,
                        "cot_trigger": "lievin-02",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's use step by step inductive reasoning, given the medical nature of the question: \n\nThe study is investigating a difference between two groups, pre-term infants and term infants, with regards to the fat content in their expressed breast milk. This suggests that we are looking for a comparative study.\n\nThere are two main types of comparative studies, observational and experimental. In an observational study, the researcher does not intervene in any way and simply observes the two groups. In an experimental study, the researcher intervenes and assigns subjects to different groups.\n\nIn this case, it would not be ethical to intervene and assign infants to different groups, so we are looking for an observational study.\n\nThere are two main types of observational studies, cross-sectional and longitudinal. In a cross-sectional study, the researcher observes the two groups at one point in time. In a longitudinal study, the researcher observes the two groups over a period of time.\n\nIn this case, it would not be possible to observe the two groups over a period of time, because we are looking at infants who have already been born. This means we are looking for a cross-sectional study.\n\nThe final type of study is a case-control study. In a case-control study, the researcher looks at a group of people with a certain condition (cases) and a group of people without the condition (controls) and looks back to see what exposure the two groups had to a certain risk factor.\n\nIn this case, we are not looking at a group of people with a certain condition and a group of people without the condition. We are looking at two groups of people (pre-term infants and term infants) and comparing them. This means we are not looking for a case-control study.\n\nThe best suited study design for this question is a cross-sectional study.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "0",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "Case control",
                                "answer_from_choices": "",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "lievin",
