                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "not A, B, or D. The correct answer is C) bloated, as heavy rainfall can cause the water level of a pond to rise and make it appear bloated.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "C",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
