                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "B) dirt quality. Crop rotation has a positive impact on soil health, which includes improving soil fertility, reducing soil erosion and compaction, and reducing pests and diseases.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "B",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
