                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: Can you repeat the question, please?\n\nProfessor: Sure. Which of these travels through the air? A) planets B) thoughts C) automobile D) music\n\nStudent: Hmm, I think it's either B or D. Can you give me a hint?\n\nProfessor: Well, think about what travels through the air that you can hear.\n\nStudent: Oh, I see. So, it must be D) music.\n\nProfessor: Correct! Music travels through the air in the form of sound waves.\n\nStudent: But wait, what about option B) thoughts? Don't they travel through the air too?\n\nProfessor: That's a good point. Thoughts are actually electrical signals in the brain, and they don't travel through the air. They're confined to the body.\n\nStudent: Okay, I understand. And what about option A) planets and option C) automobile?\n\nProfessor: Planets don't travel through the air, they move through space. And automobiles move on the ground, not through the air.\n\nStudent: Got it. Thanks for explaining that to me, professor.\n\nProfessor: You're welcome. Always happy to help.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
